#: ../../source/quality/index.md:1 6a20cd256f0a4d70922312956c9e69b9
msgid "Quality Metrics & Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:3 d35366e6f1bd41bc8bd44a029b627290
msgid "`findfmt` is engineered under the strictest software quality standards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:5 7568e723dd364d3cb34f56c08f80983b
msgid "1. Code Quality Standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:7 77f931f48d1144d081a964eaa9e6020f
msgid ""
"**100% Code Coverage**: Enforced through `pytest-cov` and Codecov CI "
"checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:8 664608a7ff6c4a9ea2a6413f08ced023
msgid ""
"**Strict Static Typing**: Verified with `ty` in pedantic mode (`all = "
"\"error\"`) and `pyproject.toml` configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:10 f9e62bda867b45caa0b886b0feac34c8
msgid ""
"**Ruff Strictness**: Formatted and linted using `ruff` with `ALL` rules "
"selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:11 4cad236af92e43499fe063e5401bbb8a
msgid "**Cyclomatic Complexity**: Monitored using `radon` and capped via `xenon`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:12 6f00c650f5734f1f8db9492818bfe5d3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Documentation Completeness**: Monitored via `interrogate` ensuring 100%"
" docstring coverage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:13 cd0596152f304450a4857ec7a8fc4a22
msgid ""
"**Prose & Style Linting**: Enforced on all Markdown documentation using "
"Vale with Google and Proselint style standards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:16 3365c61ac71b44cda6d341c9d20e0e22
msgid "2. Traversal Complexity Optimization & Performance Baselines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:18 235ae76c64b144a384783b647f936641
msgid ""
"Repository traversal performs early pruning of `.gitignore` hierarchies "
"to prevent recursing into expansive unneeded directory trees such as "
"`node_modules`, `.venv`, or compilation artifact directories in $O(1)$ "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:22 460fb6ff9a6744dc9293d116dcbcb64e
msgid ""
"Official v1.0.0 benchmarks establish traversal throughput exceeding 3,000"
" files/second on standard hierarchies and confirm bounded $O(1)$ memory "
"usage across streaming output formatters (`text`, `jsonl`, `tsv`, `csv`)."
" See [Performance Architecture & Benchmarks](performance.md) for full "
"topology baselines and regression testing procedures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:27 16d4d3c080e74ec08dcd818e3e5278f7
msgid "3. Python Runtime Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:29 c34cf929cdea4e17a1762502d214fe8a
msgid ""
"`findfmt` officially supports Python 3.11 through 3.15, with automated CI"
" matrices testing Ubuntu, macOS, and Windows. A non-gating `3.16-dev` job"
" gives early warning for the next Python release. Direct and transitive "
"dependency bounds in `pyproject.toml` are continuously verified across "
"`uv` resolution strategies (`highest`, `lowest`, `lowest-direct`), pre-"
"release modes, and fork strategies in CI and via "
"`tools/verify_quality.py` (see [Dependency Resolution Matrix & "
"Orchestration ADR](dependency_matrix.md)). See the complete analysis and "
"version matrix:"
msgstr ""
